//   The catalog label `Transfer<signed_char>` is right for this row (FableWin.pdb has the same spelling).
// Callees: CPersistContext::CheckCRC 0x00404500 (protected); binary save CDataOutputStream::WriteSLONG 0x00993EB0 through the generic inline CPersistTraits<T>::TransferBinaryOut (the signed char value sign-extended to long, movsx);
